BEFORE: {"description":"Old Riga is the heart of Riga, however, not all places of it are shown to tourists. There are a lot of these places that are not known even to the local residents.\n\nDiscover the different face of Riga. Hear fascinating facts and stories. Who hated the sculpture of the black cat in Riga and why? Why did Latvians put the golden roosters instead of the crosses on the church towers? Did you know that Latvian women are the tallest? Why the world has to be thankful to Riga for Christmas tree decorating tradition?"}
