BEFORE: {"description":"On this tour, the guide will take you to all the less famous places of the city but they are still significant to the history of the land. The professional guide will give you all the stories behind all these spots and why they have become less popular. Regardless of them being hidden, there are a lot of things to learn from the places. This two-hour tour will bring back some of the stories of the land that may have been forgotten. Be prepared to enjoy yourself and have a mind-blowing time.\nConsidering that this is Venice, you will visit old churches that are not as popular as they were but have great significance. You will also learn some stories behind some of the more famous spots that are not really talked about"}
