AFTER: {"description":"Enjoy a private, exclusive tour with your own local guide into the heart of Madrid, a city where History older than the United States is etched into every cobblestone and seasoned into every dish. This tasting tour invites you to become the protagonist of a culinary journey through the Ancient streets of the Old Town, where Cultural depth and a storied legacy meet the vibrant energy of the modern capital. From the Historic walls of Plaza Mayor to the Architectural grandeur of the Hapsburg era, you will explore a Medieval landscape shaped by a Civilization of constant Transformation. Each step through these Classical squares and the Heritage stalls of Mercado de San Miguel not only satiates your palate with gourmet treasures but also enriches your understanding of Madrid’s UNESCO Heritage-worthy soul. Join us to discover the Cultural essence and Archaeological echoes of this magnificent city through its most authentic flavors.\n\nPlease note: The program and attractions may vary based on booking date/time and crowd conditions, ensuring each visit is a unique experience."}

