BEFORE: {"description":"Explore Mykonos and realize why this Greek Island in the Aegean Sea is one of the most visited places in the world. Go beneath the surface of bars and massive dance clubs that make this island a summer party paradise and discover local landmarks with a knowledgeable guide. \n\nWalk down the most famous street on the island, learn the history behind iconic landmarks, and discover the island's archaeological heritage. Learn about the “Paraportiani Church,'' a miracle of Cycladic architecture, and explore the old port. Admire the little chapel of St. Nicholas and the narrow streets of Mykonos' Hora.\n\nTake time to photograph beautiful hidden spots and the picturesque white houses and windmills, stroll through Little Venice and explore the charms of the city."}
