BEFORE: {"description":"Go on a family adventure in Vienna, where the kids will have just as much fun sightseeing as the adults. Accompanied by a local guide, explore one of the world's most beautiful capitals on a walking tour.\n\nDiscover one of the oldest cities, not only in Europe but also in the world, with its origins dating back to the Roman era. Your whole family will have fun learning about Vienna's fascinating sites.\n\nHear the stories and legends of this ancient city. Stroll around the city center, walk down the off-beaten tracks and get impressive views of the famous cultural and architectural landmarks.\n\nGet a few giggles, from stories shared by your guide, as you wind down the off beaten paths of the city. Find out why Vienna is considered one of the most beautiful and interesting capitals of the world."}
AFTER: {"description":"Skip the crowds with this private, family-friendly walking tour in Vienna! Over two hours, explore the city’s rich historic character, moving from the grandeur of the Habsburgs’ imperial treasures to the vibrant city core. Marvel at jewels and relics that chronicle centuries of history, stroll through the manicured Burggarten, and see modern transformations of former city walls. Discover the “Giant’s Gate,” the tragic story behind Vienna State Opera’s architects, and the famous images atop St. Stephen’s Cathedral. Each street corner holds a story waiting to be uncovered. With your expert guide, enjoy an immersive experience that entertains and educates the whole family, making history come alive in Vienna’s charming streets. Perfect for family exploration and cultural discovery."}

