AFTER: {"description":"Skip the crowds—this is a private tour for your group only.\n\nTogether with a professional local guide enjoy a 2-hour walking tour that aims to showcase some of the most intriguing corners of Tampere. Start the journey from a local statue „Swans“ and gaze upon natural landscapes and the charming ambiance of always lively Tammerkoski rapids. Visit the city's historic industrial zone and learn how significant its role has been throughout the history and development of Tampere. Stroll the historic heart of the city and explore a local market hall where authentic and fresh products are showcased. Refuel energy at an Observation Tower from which beautiful panoramic views unfold. End the tour near a historic local hotel."}

