BEFORE: {"description":"Explore the beautiful city of Jyvaskyla on this 2-hour guided tour. Admire famous monuments as well as off-the-beaten-path gems and hear the tales of the famous lovers who once lived there from your local guide.\n\nStart your tour outside the Jyvaskyla Art Museum and begin your walking adventure. Admire the stunning murals in the city center and hear the romantic tales that inspired them such as the famous \"Keep Me.\"\n\nContinue to the harbor to admire views over the sea and hear the fascinating sailor love stories. Visit the most romantic spots in the city and feel free to ask your guide for recommendations after the tour."}
AFTER: {"description":"This tour combines both cultural and romantic elements, making it a unique and warm experience for you and your partner. Start your day at the Jyväskylä Art Museum, where you and your partner can admire the stunning works of art and get lost in each other's company. Next, head over to the Craft Museum of Finland to learn about the rich history of Finnish craftsmanship and maybe even find a special handmade gift for your loved one. After the museum, take a leisurely walk down the Nero Stairs, a beautiful and romantic spot with views of the surrounding nature. End your day at the Toivola Old Courtyard, where you can enjoy a cozy dinner by the fireplace and spend the evening cuddled up with your loved one."}

