[9] Date: 2023-06-28 | Status: todo | Section: description | Editor: SUPPLIER
BEFORE: {"description":"Join us on this exclusive tour for all the romantics of the world. Together with a professional local guide, you will visit the most romantic places in the Baden-Baden.\n\nBaden-Baden is a well-known spa town, perfectly suited for experiencing the finer things in life. You will be spellbound in a charming atmosphere in this quaint and cosy city.\n\nWhere can you go on a date in the city? And where can you take the most beautiful photos? What magical, romantic tales and nymphs are said to be engraved in the walls and the entrance hall of the Trinkhalle? Your guide will answer these questions and more. You will be surprised how many historic love stories are hidden in the streets, buildings, and parks of the city. From the heartbreaking and tragic, to the hilarious and spicy ones.\n\nThis tour is especially recommended in the Saint Valentine period."}
AFTER: {"description":"Enjoy a private walking tour through Baden-Baden’s historic and cultural heritage. Stroll together through Old Town streets shaped by centuries of civilization. Admire classical architecture and architectural marvels as your guide shares stories of the city’s transformation.\nWander serene parks and tranquil pathways, connecting with the timeless charm and cultural depth of Baden-Baden. Explore artistic treasures in renowned museums, experiencing the legacy of creativity and heritage. Each step blends history, culture, and romantic ambiance into an intimate journey. This private tour celebrates connection and discovery while immersing you in Baden-Baden’s architectural and classical elegance.\n\nPlease note: The program and attractions may vary based on booking date/time and crowd conditions, ensuring each visit is a unique experience"}

