BEFORE: {"description":"Step into the heart of Atlanta’s Christmas magic. This tour is crafted to make you the centerpiece of an enchanting holiday experience. Begin your journey at the majestic Peachtree Road United Methodist Church, where history and tranquility meet.\n\nThen, let the festive spirit embrace you at the Atlanta Christkindl Market, a hub of holiday cheer and perfect for finding those special Christmas gifts. For a playful twist, Fetch Park Buckhead offers a lively, pet-friendly environment where fun and festivity come together.\n\nConclude your tour at the Jackson Fine Art Gallery, enriching your holiday with artistic wonder. This tour is more than a journey through Atlanta’s festive attractions; it’s an opportunity to create heartwarming memories that will light up your holiday season.\n\nIdeal for families, friends, and all who cherish the Christmas spirit, this tour invites you to immerse in the joy and beauty of Atlanta at this most wonderful time of the year."}
AFTER: {"description":"This private walking tour reveals Atlanta’s festive atmosphere through its rich cultural heritage and remarkable history. You will explore a city shaped by transformation, resilience, and enduring traditions. Historic districts and architectural landmarks reflect chapters of a story that helped shape the modern American South. What events and cultural influences contributed to Atlanta’s lasting legacy?\n\nYou will discover heritage sites that showcase the city's evolution across generations. Seasonal markets and festive displays add a celebratory atmosphere while highlighting local traditions and community spirit. Architectural landmarks reveal the city's journey from a historic railway hub to a major cultural destination.\n\nPlease note: The program and attractions may vary based on booking date/time and crowd conditions, ensuring each visit is a unique experience."}

