BEFORE: {"description":"Embark on a journey through the enchanting village of Zermatt, where every step tells a story and every view takes your breath away. As the hero of your own adventure, you’ll wander through bustling squares, indulge in gourmet delights, and stand in awe at the foot of the majestic Matterhorn. From the historical charm of Hinterdorfstrasse to the tranquil beauty of Uferweg, this tour is a mosaic of experiences designed to captivate your senses and leave you with unforgettable memories. Join us on this exclusive journey through Zermatt’s Alpine wonders, and discover why this village isn’t just a destination, but a gateway to a world of Alpine magic."}
