BEFORE: {"description":"All participants will be divided into smaller groups of 3 to 6 persons. Each group will have one device with mobile data. After you will log in to the game website, you will get the first hint. From this hint, you will understand which direction to go in. It could be a park, monument or street etc. When you find the place, you will have to find a task.\n\nSome of the tasks can be placed obviously, but for others, you will have to search properly. Tasks can be related to math, logic or art. You may have to decode the code to measure, taste or even to broke something. When you solve the task, you will receive a code. If the code is correct, you will go to another level.\n\nEvery 5 to 7-minutes, you will get a helpful hint so you will not be stuck in any level too long. There are 8 to 12 levels in the game. It will take from 1-hour and 40 minutes to 2.5-hours. The duration will depend on your skills and luck. After the game, the results will be discussed and all teams will get certificates. The winner will be the fastest team."}
AFTER: {"description":"Step into a world of mystery and adventure with Old Town Riga Hunting Game. Immerse yourself in the rich history and culture of Riga’s iconic Old Town, as you explore its narrow streets, ancient architecture, and hidden corners. With its stunning visuals, captivating storyline, and challenging gameplay, this game offers an unforgettable experience that will transport you to another time and place. As you embark on your journey, you’ll encounter a variety of obstacles, from fiendish puzzles to cunning adversaries. But with quick wits and a sharp eye, you’ll uncover hidden treasures, decipher cryptic clues, and unlock the secrets of the city. And as you progress through the game, you’ll learn about the fascinating history and culture of Riga, from its medieval roots to its modern-day vibrancy. So come and experience the magic of Riga’s Old Town for yourself, and discover a world of wonder and excitement that you’ll never forget."}

