206292.full_description:
When did you last time walked in the forest during the night time? The nightmare begins when you are completely lost, don’t know where to go and sounds in the bushes are becoming more and more scary. All participants are divided into 2 or 3 teams, then each team is left alone in different spot, after this the search of correct path starts. This game is perfect opportunity to learn team work, survival tricks or just simply celebrate party in the unique way. Besides you will see moon-lit forest during night time. We promise your skin will shiver!

Tasks: 1. Find members of opponents team in the dark;
2. Light the bonfire which will burn for at least 1 minute (each team will be given 1 box of matches);
3. Find the way out of the forest (white sheet of paper will mark the exit, you will see it in the beginning of the game).

