BEFORE: {"description":"Get ready to experience Antoni Gaudi’s legacy from a different perspective as you admire his greatest masterpiece's in the company of a local guide who will tell you the most interesting facts about each piece. \n\nDiscover who Antoni Gaudi was and why his works have received international acclaim on this guided tour. Learn why this Catalan architect chose Barcelona as the backdrop for his masterpieces, why he was often referred to as 'God's Architect', the influence of religion on his architecture and much more.\n\nDuring the tour, discover some of Gaudi's greatest works such as the unfinished Sagrada Família Basilica, the otherworldly Park Güell, and the modernist Casa Batlló. Their beauty, forms, colors, and overall design will take your breath away."}
