BEFORE: {"description":"Visit the peaceful and charming city Zadar in Croatia on a walking tour. See the famous attractions of the city with a professional guide. Stroll through the streets of burnished marble and witness the beautiful archaeological landmarks of the city. You will get the chance to explore the main highlights while hearing fascinating facts and legends from your expert guide.\n\nHear about the stories of the first evidence of human life that was traced back to Zadar. The picturesque city is home to Roman ruins and beautiful churches. Some UNESCO insiders think that Zadar will become Croatia’s newest World Heritage Site. Walk across the quaint old town and see the museums, churches, and monuments.\n\nYour guide will tell you about the city’s unique way of life. Enjoy a scenic tour of the beautiful city in the northern Dalmatian region."}
