BEFORE: {"description":"Experience a tour tailor-made for the romantics of the world. With your local guide, visit the most romantic spots in the picturesque Český Krumlov and hear the romantic tales behind every turn.\n\nStart your tour at the breathtaking Český Krumlov Castle and navigate the winding paths in the charming historical center. Admire the well-preserved baroque and gothic architecture all around you and pass impressive monuments.\n\nAs you stroll, discover the charming tales and legends of the famous lovers who once lived in the city. Hear interesting anecdotes and facts, like how the theatre in the castle has a revolving auditorium.\n\nBefore finishing your tour, feel free to ask your guide for recommendations on the most romantic bars, restaurants, and attractions to visit in the city."}
AFTER: {"description":"Let the magic of Český Krumlov sweep you off your feet under the starlit sky of this enchanting town. Imagine wandering hand in hand with your loved one, where every cobblestone and corner whispers tales from the past, against the breathtaking backdrop of this UNESCO World Heritage Site. This isn’t just a walk; it’s a journey through time, where each moment promises to unveil the hidden charms of Český Krumlov. This tour takes you through places where the romance of the town blooms – from mesmerizing views that leave you spellbound to secret spots where the essence of love feels palpable. Let’s embark on this adventure together, crafting memories in Český Krumlov that will be treasured forever."}

