BEFORE: {"description":"Enjoy Christmastime in Berlin with a tour of Berlin Cathedral, traditional Alexanderplatz Christmas Market, and Berlin center. Let your professional guide lead you to the most beautifully decorated places in the city. Feel spellbound with the charming atmosphere in the streets, unique to this special time of the year.\n\nVisit the old-fashioned Christmas Market in Alexanderplatz. Learn what makes it so popular from your guide. Be introduced to must-taste local products. Walk past vendors selling traditional crafts, Christmas products, mulled wine and other delights.\n\nSpend 30 minutes admiring the Berlin Cathedral from outside. Then, be whisked away to Berlin center for an hour. Fill your heart with festive joy and experience the magic of Berlin at Christmas.\n\nFind out the story of the Christmas tree. Who was the first to decorate it in the world? What magical things can happen during the Christmas period? Hear about Christmas spells and miraculous Christmas legends of Berlin city."}
