BEFORE: {"description":"Together with a professional guide, visit the most charming and iconic places in La Condamine, Monaco, on this walking tour. Learn the stories hidden in the streets, buildings, and corners, and discover what makes living here is so special.\nStart your tour at La Condamine’s Théâtre des Variétés. From there, continue exploring the area while hearing fascinating facts and legends from your local guide.\nRich in culture and history, La Condamine is the second oldest area of Monaco (after Monaco-Ville). Of the many things that make this place special, the Monaco Grand Prix starts and finishes in La Condamine. \nThis tour is perfect for those who are visiting La Condamine for the first time and want to get the most of their visit."}
AFTER: {"description":"Discover the vibrant “La Condamine Charms: Monaco’s Markets and Marvels” on this half-day tour through one of Monaco’s most lively districts. Begin your journey at the picturesque Port Hercule, enjoying waterfront views and opulent yachts. Dive into local culture at Le Marché de la Condamine, sampling traditional Monégasque cuisine. Visit the serene Saint-Nicolas Church for a moment of tranquility, then treat yourself at the luxurious Chocolaterie de Monaco. Enjoy a leisurely stroll along Rue Princesse Caroline, absorbing the local shopping scene. Cap off your tour with a visit to the Private Cars Collection of HSH Prince of Monaco, where automotive history comes to life. This tour offers a unique blend of Monaco’s culinary, cultural, and historical highlights, perfect for those looking to experience the essence of La Condamine in a short time.\n\nPlease note: The availability and accessibility of attractions may vary based on time of day and crowd conditions, ensuring each visit is a unique experience."}

