BEFORE: {"description":"Experience the magic of the holiday season on this special Christmas tour of Albuquerque. From twinkling lights to festive markets, there’s so much to see and do in this beautiful city. The Magic Christmas Tour at Expo New Mexico is an exciting and festive event that offers a variety of attractions for the whole family to enjoy. The Flea Market at Expo New Mexico is a great place to find unique gifts and holiday decorations. The Grandstand at The Downs is a perfect spot to watch thrilling horse races, while the Manuel Lujan Jr. Exhibit Complex offers a chance to learn about the rich cultural history of the area. Each of these attractions offers something special and unique that adds to the magic of the Christmas season. Whether you’re looking to shop for gifts, catch some exciting racing action, or learn about the local history, the Magic Christmas Tour at Expo New Mexico has something for everyone."}
